rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"10600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1058","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[79,71,78,77,70,81],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"10600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1058","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[79,71,78,77,70,81],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"10600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1059","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":2,"stats":[79,71,78,77,70,81],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"100","reputation":"10600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1020","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,71,78,77,70,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10038","city":"CS1071","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,71,78,77,70,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"最长寿的东吴名将。东吴政权刚刚稳定时，与蒋钦等人四处平定叛乱。荆州纷争期间，吕岱随孙权进攻长沙，督率十将击破安成四县抵抗，后又斩杀响应关羽的袁龙，稳定荆州南线。成功夺取三郡，升任为庐陵太守。黄武五年，平定士徽叛乱，控制岭南，升为镇南将军。陆逊去世后吕岱升任大将军，孙亮登基后升任大司马。一生戮力奉公，为孙吴开疆拓土，功勋赫赫。太平元年，去世，年九十六。","tc":"最長壽的東吳名將。東吳政權剛剛穩定時，與蔣欽等人四處平定叛亂。荊州紛爭期間，呂岱隨孫權進攻長沙，督率十將擊破安成四縣抵抗，后又斬殺響應關羽的袁龍，穩定荊州南線。成功奪取三郡，升任為廬陵太守。黃武五年，平定士徽叛亂，控制嶺南，升為鎮南將軍。陸遜去世后呂岱升任大將軍，孫亮登基后升任大司馬。一生戮力奉公，為孫吳開疆拓土，功勛赫赫。太平元年，去世，年九十六。","en":"The longest-lived of the famed generals of Eastern Wu. When the Wu regime was first stabilized, he joined Jiang Qin and others in pacifying revolts throughout the territory. During the Jing Province conflicts, Lu Dai accompanied Sun Quan in the attack on Changsha, commanding ten subordinate generals to overcome resistance in the four counties of Ancheng. He later killed Yuan Long, who had rallied in support of Guan Yu, stabilizing the southern front of Jing Province. His successful conquest of the three commanderies earned him appointment as Governor of Luling. In the fifth year of Huangwu (226), he suppressed the rebellion of Shi Hui, gained control of the Lingnan region, and was promoted to South Off. (subjugation). After Lu Xun's death, Lu Dai was elevated to Grand General. Following Sun Liang's accession, he was further promoted to Grand Minister. A lifelong devotee of duty, he expanded Wu's territory and built an illustrious record of service. He passed away in the first year of Taiping (256) at the age of ninety-six.","jp":"東呉で最も長命を誇った名将。東呉政権の黎明期、蒋欽らとともに各地の反乱を平定した。荊州をめぐる争いでは孫権に従って長沙へ進軍し、十将を率いて安成など四県の抵抗を打ち破り、後に関羽に呼応した袁龍を討ち取って荊州南部の戦線を安定させた。三郡の奪取に成功した功により廬陵太守に昇進。黄武五年には士徽の反乱を平定して嶺南を制圧し、鎮南将軍に進んだ。陸遜の死後は大将軍、孫亮の即位後は大司馬に昇進した。生涯にわたり公のために力を尽くし、孫呉の領土を切り拓いて赫々たる功績を残した。太平元年に死去、享年九十六。","kr":"동오에서 가장 장수한 명장. 동오 정권이 막 안정을 찾아갈 무렵 장흠 등과 함께 각지의 반란을 평정했다. 형주 분쟁 시기에는 손권을 따라 장사를 공격하였고, 열 명의 장수를 이끌고 안성 등 4개 현의 저항을 격파했으며, 이후 관우에게 호응한 원룡을 참수하여 형주 남부 전선을 안정시켰다. 3개 군을 성공적으로 평정하여 여릉태수로 승진했다. 황무 5년에는 사휘의 반란을 평정하고 영남을 장악하여 진남장군으로 승진했다. 육손이 사망한 뒤 대장군으로 승진했고, 손량이 즉위하자 대사마에 올랐다. 평생토록 힘을 다해 공무에 헌신하며 손오의 강역을 넓혀 혁혁한 공훈을 세웠다. 태평 원년에 향년 96세로 세상을 떠났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10351","remark":"","surname":"吕","surnameTc":"呂","surnameEn":"Lu","surnameJp":"呂","surnameKr":"여","surnameOther":"","name":"岱","nameTc":"岱","nameEn":"Dai","nameJp":"岱","nameKr":"대","nameOther":"","word":"定公","wordTc":"定公","wordEn":"Dinggong","wordJp":"定公","wordKr":"정공","wordOther":"","icon":"吕岱","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1020","gender":"0","rule":"79","force":"71","wise":"78","politics":"77","charm":"70","will":"81","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"25/25/71/25/25/20/34/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012005","debateSoul":"1004501","warSoulPoint":"5600","battleSoulPoint":"5000","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1001305","strategy2":"1010601;1010201","professions":"2/3/0/3/3/4/3/2/3/3/1/2/2/0/2/3/3/2/0/0/2/1/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"86","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"161","show":"184","death":"256","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"4","weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;10/1;25/1;27/1;13/0;30/2;24/1;45/1;3/0;2/0;38/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"最长寿的东吴名将。东吴政权刚刚稳定时，与蒋钦等人四处平定叛乱。荆州纷争期间，吕岱随孙权进攻长沙，督率十将击破安成四县抵抗，后又斩杀响应关羽的袁龙，稳定荆州南线。成功夺取三郡，升任为庐陵太守。黄武五年，平定士徽叛乱，控制岭南，升为镇南将军。陆逊去世后吕岱升任大将军，孙亮登基后升任大